    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7ccf078558265b1768ffdf9c9e9b60f6684aaf4a3e0d6d258a1f1e36c72b54f0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n先穿袜子，再穿鞋。\n一张卡片，一个步骤。\n你的机器人会做什么？\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
